From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 20:36:48 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Make Nawy Notes mobile-first and improve PWA install

- 3-row mobile header, full-width search, scrollable tabs, 44px touch targets
- 2-column cards, hover gated to fine pointers, safe-area + dvh handling
- full-screen editor on phones with visualViewport keyboard fit and back-gesture close
- install button (beforeinstallprompt / iOS Safari hint / hidden when installed) + tests
- SW update prompt instead of auto reload

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
